      <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--color-text-tertiary);margin-top:4px;">Perceived control is as important as actual danger in determining phobic intensity. The same physical height is less frightening behind a railing than at an open edge.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- ═══════════════ PART G ═══════════════ -->
